   "lines": [
    "The other day a dog",
    "annoyed me very",
    "much while on",
    "horseback, and I",
    "told the owner I",
    "should shoot it; which",
    "threat I fulfilled",
    "while out riding",
    "with West today,",
    "rolling it over with",
    "my revolver very",
    "neatly as it ran",
    "alongside the horse."
   ],
